@startuml
title Успешный сценарий: Прохождение курса и сдача теста

actor "Студент" as Student
participant "Клиент (Web/Mobile)" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Video CDN" as CDN
participant "Test Module" as TestSvc
queue "Event Bus\n(RabbitMQ)" as Bus
participant "Notification\nService" as Notify

== Транзакция №1: Запуск и просмотр видео ==

Student -> Client: Нажимает "Начать обучение"
activate Client

Client -> Gateway: POST /api/courses/{id}/start
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Gateway: Аутентификация\nи проверка прав
Gateway -> DB: INSERT progress\n(course_id='C-101', status='IN_PROGRESS')
activate DB
DB --> Gateway: OK (id='P-99')
deactivate DB

Gateway --> Client: 200 OK\n{status: "IN_PROGRESS"}
deactivate Gateway

Client -> CDN: GET /video/lesson-01.mp4
activate CDN
CDN --> Client: 200 OK\n(Video Stream)
deactivate CDN

note over Client, Student
  Студент смотрит видео.
  Прогресс отправляется в фоне.
end note

Client -> Gateway: PATCH /api/progress\n{video_progress: 100%}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> DB: UPDATE progress\nSET video_percent=100
DB --> Gateway: OK
Gateway --> Client: 200 OK\n{test_unlocked: true}
deactivate Gateway

== Транзакция №2: Сдача теста ==

Student -> Client: Отвечает на вопросы\nи нажимает "Завершить тест"
Client -> Gateway: POST /api/tests/submit\n{answers: [...]}
activate Gateway

Gateway -> TestSvc: ValidateAndGrade(answers)
activate TestSvc

TestSvc -> TestSvc: Проверка ответов\nРасчёт баллов
TestSvc --> Gateway: Result: score=80%, passed=true
deactivate TestSvc

Gateway -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Gateway -> DB: UPDATE progress\nSET status='COMPLETED', score=80%
Gateway -> DB: INSERT test_result\n(score=80%, attempts=1)
DB --> Gateway: Committed
deactivate DB

Gateway -> Bus: publish(CourseCompleted,\nuser='U-42', badge='B-01')
activate Bus
Bus --> Gateway: ACK
deactivate Bus

Gateway --> Client: 200 OK\n{score: "80%", passed: true,\nbadge: "Основы дизайна"}
deactivate Gateway

note over Student
  Тест пройден!
  Бейдж добавлен в профиль.
end note

== Шаг 3: Асинхронное уведомление и комментарий ==

Bus -> Notify: consume(CourseCompleted)
activate Notify
Notify -> Notify: Формирование push/email
Notify --> Student: 📱 Push: "Поздравляем!\nВы успешно прошли курс!"
deactivate Notify

Student -> Client: Оставляет комментарий:\n"Коротко и по делу, спасибо!"
Client -> Gateway: POST /api/comments\n{course_id: 'C-101', text: '...'}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> DB: INSERT comment\n(user='U-42', text='...')
activate DB
DB --> Gateway: OK
deactivate DB
Gateway --> Client: 201 Created\n{comment_id: 'COM-88'}
deactivate Gateway

Client --> Student: Комментарий опубликован ✅
deactivate Client

' @enduml